sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User Browser
    participant UI as ChatInterface (React)
    participant API as ApiService (api.ts)
    participant FastAPI as FastAPI Server (main.py)
    participant RAG as RAGPipeline (rag_pipeline.py)
    participant VDB as VectorDatabase (vector_database.py)
    participant ST as SentenceTransformer (MiniLM)
    participant Chroma as ChromaDB ('legal_qa')
    participant Ollama as Ollama API (:11434/api/generate)

    User->>UI: Types query & submits (Enter / Click Send)
    UI->>API: sendChatMessage({ query, conversation_id, top_k: 5 })
    API->>FastAPI: POST /api/chat (JSON payload)
    
    FastAPI->>RAG: query(query, top_k=5, conversation_id)
    Note over RAG: Generates UUID if conversation_id is None
    
    RAG->>VDB: search(query, n_results=5)
    VDB->>ST: encode([query]) -> 384-dim vector
    ST-->>VDB: query_embedding
    VDB->>Chroma: collection.query(query_embeddings, n_results=5)
    Chroma-->>VDB: { documents: [[...]], metadatas: [[...]], distances: [[...]] }
    VDB-->>RAG: context { documents, metadatas, distances }
    
    Note over RAG: avg_distance = sum(distances) / len(distances)<br/>avg_similarity = 1 - avg_distance<br/>use_rag = (avg_similarity >= 0.35)
    
    alt use_rag is True (avg_similarity >= 0.35)
        Note over RAG: Inject System Prompt + Retrieved Q&A Context + Last 3 Turns History
    else use_rag is False (avg_similarity < 0.35)
        Note over RAG: Inject General Legal Assistant Prompt (No context) + Last 3 Turns History
    end
    
    RAG->>Ollama: POST /api/generate { model: 'qwen3:8b', prompt, stream: false, options: { temperature: 0.2, num_predict: 1500 } }
    Ollama-->>RAG: { response: "Generated legal text..." }
    
    Note over RAG: update_conversation_history (window max 10 msgs)
    
    RAG-->>FastAPI: { response, documents, metadatas, conversation_id, mode, similarity_score }
    Note over FastAPI: Formats sources list: title, source, category, url, preview
    FastAPI-->>API: ChatResponse { response, sources, conversation_id, timestamp }
    API-->>UI: ChatResponse
    UI->>User: Renders bot answer & source reference cards
